  "notes": [
   "The PDF has no inventory pages, so Element IDs are unknown. Catalogue types were used where a piece looked similar, and the rest are new types with made-up ids. Parts and counts are inferred from the step pictures.",
   "Steps 2-3 are read as two yellow wedge plates on the black 2x6 plate. Step 4 is read as two black deck plates plus two red 1x1 plates. Which plate sits under which is a guess.",
   "Step 8's dark grey blocks are read as two axle holders under the chassis, each with an axle. Step 11 shows four yellow-hub wheels, one on each axle end.",
   "Step 9 is read as a second arm segment. The hinge plate, arm and bucket joints are modelled as revolute.",
   "Minifig ids m1-m4 come after b21 in the list, but the manual builds the minifig first. A few small black pieces in steps 8-10, such as the flag/antenna, are omitted because they could not be identified."
  ]
